WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:05.340
My family and I find ourselves in an interesting situation.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:06.540
Can I help you?

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.760
Looking for John Dutton.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.880
Yeah. Who's looking for John Dutton?

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.340
The walls are closing in all sides.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.020
We're fighting to survive.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.400
Your father's ranch isn't a kingdom and he isn't a king.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.640
Your family deserves to lose everything.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.180
There are wolves everywhere here.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.480
I run this valley.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.520
And there's a war coming.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.820
You bet your ass it's coming.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.860
This is where change begins.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.200
With new partnerships.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.515
They will pull you.

00:00:42.515 --> 00:00:45.750
They will twist you and tear you into tiny pieces.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.247
To beat her, I have to attack him.

00:00:49.247 --> 00:00:50.610
I have to play dirty.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.440
We're about to find out how big a role you play

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:56.279
in this family, son.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.360
You understand what I'm asking.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:05.800
Loyalty, morality, not part of the equation for you.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:07.600
I ran so far from this place.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.440
I don't think it factors in at all.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.700
This cannot be fixed.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.940
All the angels are gone, son.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.860
There's only Devils left.

